# Rebinding a typed reference to the untyped letter admits it at run time and binds it like receiveMessage: a path
# through the reference right after it -- before any checkpoint -- reads the letter.  (A MainLetter value is callable,
# so `m: raw` on one is its call; the rebinding is `@: MainLetter m` / `m: @raw`, OPUS-CALLABLE-STRUCT-BINDING-
# 20260929-16.)
MainLetter:
    char: []: []: mainArgs
end: MainLetter

@: MainLetter m
receiveMessage: raw
m: @raw
sendMessage: exit(exit_code: length(m\mainArgs); stdout: ""; stderr: "")
return
